---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
---
<Base title="Accessibility Statement | JP Web Design"
      description="How this site is built for accessibility, what has been tested, and how to report a barrier.">
  <Legal heading="Accessibility" updated="July 2026">
    <h2 class="h3">The standard</h2>
    <p class="body">This site targets WCAG 2.2 Level AA. That is a target held to deliberately,
    not a badge — and every site I build for a client is held to the same one.</p>

    <h2 class="h3">What that means here</h2>
    <ul class="rows">
      <li class="row"><span class="row__n">01</span><div class="row__b"><p class="small">Every
      interactive element is reachable and operable by keyboard, with a visible focus
      indicator.</p></div></li>
      <li class="row"><span class="row__n">02</span><div class="row__b"><p class="small">Text
      meets 4.5:1 contrast, interface components 3:1. No information is carried by colour
      alone — selected states also change shape and weight.</p></div></li>
      <li class="row"><span class="row__n">03</span><div class="row__b"><p class="small">The
      planner uses native form controls, announces each step to screen readers, and never
      re-asks a question you have already answered.</p></div></li>
      <li class="row"><span class="row__n">04</span><div class="row__b"><p class="small">All
      motion respects <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>. Nothing animates that would obscure
      or delay content.</p></div></li>
      <li class="row"><span class="row__n">05</span><div class="row__b"><p class="small">Touch
      targets are at least 44×44 pixels, above the 24-pixel minimum.</p></div></li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h3">Known gaps</h2>
    <p class="body todo">Full assistive-technology testing across NVDA, JAWS, VoiceOver and
    TalkBack is scheduled before launch. This section will list anything found and not yet
    fixed, honestly, rather than being removed.</p>

    <h2 class="h3">Found a barrier?</h2>
    <p class="body">Email <a class="tlink" href="mailto:jp@jpwebdesign.com">jp@jpwebdesign.com</a>
    and describe what happened and what you were using. I will reply within one business day
    and tell you when it will be fixed.</p>
  </Legal>
</Base>
